                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Bambino Rally 3 is a mediocre racing game that has a surprisingly good soundtrack.  With a handful of small indie rock/metal bands I've never heard of and cannot even find some of the songs on the internet.  Fortunately, the soundtrack is available on Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yeJNLS_xeS0  The individual tracks are included in the game folder: Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Bambino Rally 3\\scriptsAndAssets\\data\\music\\ in ogg format.  Some of the songs contain a few curse words so maybe don't play around small children or wear headphones.\n\nSeriously, the game is totally worth a couple of bucks just for this amazing soundtrack.  It is also fun for a few hours - nothing special (bland graphics, physics, AI), but it is a nice little adrenaline rush.",
